# Germanium · Ge · gate 32

**Germanium** (Ge) is element **32** of the periodic table — a **metalloid**, period 4, group 14, p-block, solid at standard conditions, atomic weight **72.630**.

## The element (carbon layer — reference chemistry)
The metalloid of the first transistor; now fiber-optic cores and infrared lenses.

